  m_Name: Evento_OndaDeCriminalidade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Onda de Criminalidade
  _titleEn: Crime Wave
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Uma onda de viol\xEAncia paralisa a cidade: com\xE9rcio fecha, transporte
    para e as pessoas evitam sair."
  _summaryEn: 'A wave of violence paralyzes the city: shops close, transport stops
    and people avoid going out.'
  _realWorld: "Em maio de 2006, ataques coordenados pelo PCC contra for\xE7as de
    seguran\xE7a e \xF4nibus pararam S\xE3o Paulo por dias."
  _realWorldEn: "In May 2006, coordinated attacks by the PCC gang against security
    forces and buses brought S\xE3o Paulo to a halt for days."
  _tradeOffs: "Respostas s\xF3 de for\xE7a tendem a escalar a viol\xEAncia; intelig\xEAncia
    e preven\xE7\xE3o atacam as causas."
  _tradeOffsEn: Responses based only on force tend to escalate violence; intelligence
    and prevention tackle the causes.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Ataques do PCC (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ataques_do_PCC
